{
    "title": "White Noise Deep Sleep Sounds",
    "description": "<b>Check out White Noise Deep Sleep Sounds!</b>\r\n\r\nEnjoy better sleep all night time long with the #1 sound machine app with 250+ calming soundscapes like white, green, and grey noises as well as rain, wind, ocean, and other nature sounds.\r\n\r\n<b>White Noise and Deep Sleep Sounds help kids and adults sleep well by:</b>\r\n- Blocking out unwanted loud noises with customizable background noise options like green, grey, brown, etc.\r\n- Forming a calming sleep association that cues you to fall asleep\r\n- Helping you feel calm, relaxed, and soothing\r\n- Providing tinnitus relief by suppressing it with brown noise\r\n\r\n<b>White Noise and Deep Sleep Fan Sounds help you study and focus by:</b>\r\n- Improving your focus and boosting your creativity\r\n- Creating a pleasant and zen-like environment for meditation\r\n\r\n<b>White Noise and Deep Sleep Sounds include the following sleep sounds:</b>\r\n\r\nAirplane Sounds\r\nAir Conditioner Noise\r\nWind Noise\r\nBedtime Fan Noises\r\nBaby Shushers\r\nClothes Dryer Sounds\r\nHairdryer sounds\r\nVacuum Cleaner Sounds\r\nRain Sounds\r\nWomb Sound\r\nBird Sounds\r\nCrickets\r\nWhite Noise Ocean Waves\r\nThunderstorm Sounds\r\nRoaring Fire\r\nBinaural Beats\r\nBrown Noise\r\nPink Noise\r\nWhite Noise\r\nGreen Noise\r\n\r\nOur noisemaker is fully customizable, allowing you to mix nature melodies and sleep sounds to create your soothing soundscapes for relaxation. Plus, we have an <b>ASMR</b> section with slime, whispers, and more ASMR sounds guaranteed to give you the tingles.\r\n\r\nWith a wide variety of soothing sounds to choose from, including peaceful sounds, melodies of rain, and other noises for sleep, you'll be able to create the perfect sleep environment. An ultimate aid for a restful night's sleep is here. Our white noise machine features a variety of bedtime fan noises, as well as other calming sounds to help you fall asleep faster and stay asleep longer if you're a light sleeper or have trouble getting to sleep.\r\n\r\nGo beyond the standard free white noise machine app with the Premium version, which includes sounds of animals, nature, and more calming nighttime sounds. Try the \"magic\" white noise machine app that has people saying hello to sweet dreams! With over 250+ soothing sounds, \"White Noise and Deep Sleep Sounds\" is better than an actual sound machine. We professionally record all of our sounds to add the perfect background noise or ambiance to your bedroom or nursery.\r\n\r\nExplore our brand new <b>sleep music</b> category.  The classical music and lullabies for babies sections feature calming piano melodies.  The relaxing music & melodies section includes ambient and atmospheric tones composed exclusively for Deep Sleep Fan Sounds.\r\n\r\nWhite Noise Deep Sleep Sounds offers the perfect green nature, brown, pink, and grey noises, and bedtime fan sounds to help you calm and relax for sleep. Try our sound machine now and sleep better.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Check out White Noise Deep Sleep Sounds!</b><br><br>Enjoy better sleep all night time long with the #1 sound machine app with 250+ calming soundscapes like white, green, and grey noises as well as rain, wind, ocean, and other nature sounds.<br><br><b>White Noise and Deep Sleep Sounds help kids and adults sleep well by:</b><br>- Blocking out unwanted loud noises with customizable background noise options like green, grey, brown, etc.<br>- Forming a calming sleep association that cues you to fall asleep<br>- Helping you feel calm, relaxed, and soothing<br>- Providing tinnitus relief by suppressing it with brown noise<br><br><b>White Noise and Deep Sleep Fan Sounds help you study and focus by:</b><br>- Improving your focus and boosting your creativity<br>- Creating a pleasant and zen-like environment for meditation<br><br><b>White Noise and Deep Sleep Sounds include the following sleep sounds:</b><br><br>Airplane Sounds<br>Air Conditioner Noise<br>Wind Noise<br>Bedtime Fan Noises<br>Baby Shushers<br>Clothes Dryer Sounds<br>Hairdryer sounds<br>Vacuum Cleaner Sounds<br>Rain Sounds<br>Womb Sound<br>Bird Sounds<br>Crickets<br>White Noise Ocean Waves<br>Thunderstorm Sounds<br>Roaring Fire<br>Binaural Beats<br>Brown Noise<br>Pink Noise<br>White Noise<br>Green Noise<br><br>Our noisemaker is fully customizable, allowing you to mix nature melodies and sleep sounds to create your soothing soundscapes for relaxation. Plus, we have an <b>ASMR</b> section with slime, whispers, and more ASMR sounds guaranteed to give you the tingles.<br><br>With a wide variety of soothing sounds to choose from, including peaceful sounds, melodies of rain, and other noises for sleep, you&#39;ll be able to create the perfect sleep environment. An ultimate aid for a restful night&#39;s sleep is here. Our white noise machine features a variety of bedtime fan noises, as well as other calming sounds to help you fall asleep faster and stay asleep longer if you&#39;re a light sleeper or have trouble getting to sleep.<br><br>Go beyond the standard free white noise machine app with the Premium version, which includes sounds of animals, nature, and more calming nighttime sounds. Try the &quot;magic&quot; white noise machine app that has people saying hello to sweet dreams! With over 250+ soothing sounds, &quot;White Noise and Deep Sleep Sounds&quot; is better than an actual sound machine. We professionally record all of our sounds to add the perfect background noise or ambiance to your bedroom or nursery.<br><br>Explore our brand new <b>sleep music</b> category.  The classical music and lullabies for babies sections feature calming piano melodies.  The relaxing music &amp; melodies section includes ambient and atmospheric tones composed exclusively for Deep Sleep Fan Sounds.<br><br>White Noise Deep Sleep Sounds offers the perfect green nature, brown, pink, and grey noises, and bedtime fan sounds to help you calm and relax for sleep. Try our sound machine now and sleep better.",
